    dialogueOptions:
    - drink
    - s_drink
    cost: "Darkness no longer adds to Stealth skill; a later price only foreshadowed (99 VS-DROP)"
    consequence: "Fog sense: every observer's Notice Meter and its clear Vision Cone, as Perception 4 and Intelligence 6 would show"
    opens: "Priced power proven"
    closes: "Refusal's purity; later Soft Memory hooks out of slice scope"
    failure: "None in the slice"
